      "created_at": "2025-08-05T09:02:39.330Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/amit_kumar1\">@Amit_Kumar1</a></p>\n<p>You can achieve this instantly as following;</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>the easiest way to make Posting Date read only and set default as Today But this wont let you record on back dates as well.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The following client script may help and you have to create client script record for each of the form you want to be applied under this case;</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/a/1a9ae93398d254a4c8c32d4cf209b03d535d254e.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/1a9ae93398d254a4c8c32d4cf209b03d535d254e\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/a/1a9ae93398d254a4c8c32d4cf209b03d535d254e_2_690x315.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"3Nmjbk6l4R5hq16rJlezW4aSQJE\" width=\"690\" height=\"315\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/a/1a9ae93398d254a4c8c32d4cf209b03d535d254e_2_690x315.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/a/1a9ae93398d254a4c8c32d4cf209b03d535d254e_2_1035x472.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/a/1a9ae93398d254a4c8c32d4cf209b03d535d254e_2_1380x630.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F6F5F5\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1912×874 70.2 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>and this how system will react after working with client script.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/d/9dee5d469e2c716c88a0082a35f09e890cb109f3.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/9dee5d469e2c716c88a0082a35f09e890cb109f3\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/d/9dee5d469e2c716c88a0082a35f09e890cb109f3_2_690x292.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"mx7EGdt4KjEc9WLBo3ndPZqMoo3\" width=\"690\" height=\"292\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/d/9dee5d469e2c716c88a0082a35f09e890cb109f3_2_690x292.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/d/9dee5d469e2c716c88a0082a35f09e890cb109f3_2_1035x438.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/d/9dee5d469e2c716c88a0082a35f09e890cb109f3_2_1380x584.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"706F6D\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1906×808 59.4 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Here is the code particularly for sales invoice and you can throw any message you like;</p>\n<p>frappe.ui.form.on(‘Sales Invoice’, {<br>\nvalidate: function(frm) {<br>\nconst today = frappe.datetime.get_today();<br>\nconst postingDate = frm.doc.posting_date;</p>\n<pre><code>    if (postingDate &gt; today) {\n        frappe.throw(__('You cannot record in future date.'));\n    }\n}\n</code></pre>\n<p>});</p>",
